---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Privacy Policy | Next Wave Dev" description="Learn how we collect, use, and protect your data.">
  <div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-[1440px] overflow-hidden bg-background px-5 pb-0 pt-10 text-white md:px-8 md:pt-12">
    <section class="mx-auto w-full max-w-[1289px] px-0">
      
      <!-- UNIFIED RESPONSIVE PAGE HERO -->
      <div class="w-full flex flex-col lg:overflow-hidden rounded-[10px] bg-gradient-to-b from-surface to-background border border-border-subtle p-6 md:p-0 shadow-xl mt-4 md:mt-0">
        <section class="relative flex flex-col lg:flex-row lg:h-[489px] w-full items-center text-center md:text-left gap-6 md:gap-0">
          
          <div class="xl:absolute xl:left-[47px] xl:top-[19px] z-10 flex h-[150px] w-[150px] xl:h-[390px] xl:w-[390px] shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-gradient-to-r from-accent-primary to-accent-secondary border border-border-subtle shadow-2xl mx-auto md:mx-0 p-2 md:p-8">
            <span class="block w-full font-heading text-[18px] sm:text-[20px] md:text-[48px] lg:text-[52px] font-bold leading-tight md:leading-[1.1] text-white text-center drop-shadow-md break-words">
              Privacy<br/>Policy
            </span>
          </div>
          
          <div class="xl:absolute xl:left-[470px] flex flex-col w-full xl:w-[650px] gap-3 md:gap-4 z-10 md:pr-8">
            <h1 class="m-0 font-roboto text-[22px] md:text-[48px] lg:text-[56px] font-bold leading-tight md:leading-[1.1] text-white break-words">Data & Privacy</h1>
            <p class="m-0 font-sans text-[15px] md:text-[22px] lg:text-[24px] font-normal leading-relaxed md:leading-[33px] text-text-body">How Next Wave Dev collects, uses, and protects your personal information.</p>
          </div>
          
        </section>
      </div>
      
    </section>

    <!-- Content Block -->
    <section class="mx-auto w-full max-w-[1000px] mt-16 md:mt-24 pb-12">
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-8 rounded-[20px] bg-surface border border-border-subtle p-8 shadow-xl lg:p-12">
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-4">
          <h3 class="font-roboto text-[24px] md:text-[32px] font-bold text-white">1. Information We Collect</h3>
          <p class="font-sans text-[16px] md:text-[18px] font-normal leading-relaxed text-text-body">We collect information that you voluntarily provide to us when you express an interest in obtaining information about us or our services, when you participate in activities on our website, or when you contact us. This includes names, email addresses, phone numbers, and inquiry details submitted through our contact forms.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-4">
          <h3 class="font-roboto text-[24px] md:text-[32px] font-bold text-white">2. How We Use Your Information</h3>
          <p class="font-sans text-[16px] md:text-[18px] font-normal leading-relaxed text-text-body">We use the personal information collected via our website to fulfill and manage your service requests, process payments and donations, communicate with you regarding your projects, and send administrative information.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-4">
          <h3 class="font-roboto text-[24px] md:text-[32px] font-bold text-white">3. Third-Party Service Providers</h3>
          <p class="font-sans text-[16px] md:text-[18px] font-normal leading-relaxed text-text-body">Next Wave Dev utilizes trusted third-party platforms to operate our services securely. We use <strong>Google Forms</strong> to process and manage contact and volunteer inquiries. We use <strong>Stripe</strong> as our secure payment gateway to process monthly service subscriptions. We use <strong>Zeffy</strong> to process charitable donations. We do not directly store or process your credit card information on our servers; this data is handled securely by our payment processors according to their respective privacy policies.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-4">
          <h3 class="font-roboto text-[24px] md:text-[32px] font-bold text-white">4. Your Data Rights</h3>
          <p class="font-sans text-[16px] md:text-[18px] font-normal leading-relaxed text-text-body">You have the right to request access to the personal data we hold about you, request corrections to any inaccurate data, or request the deletion of your personal information. To make a data request, please contact us at support@nextwavedev.org.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</Layout>